Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lingered here and let our pretty\Nsparks of life blend aloud and disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves cast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart adrift It's been your\Nkindness and your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from\Nthe mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on Sail to a\Nnew dawn Weigh anchor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,ride as high as you can I assure I\Ndon't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're dashing together No,\Nwe're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you know The whole world may\Nnow be my enemy What a swirl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing\Ndown so long as I'm free
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd give it, come ride\Nthe current with me All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark is the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fierce is the storm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind blows
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At Onigashima
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon roars. The howling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,beasts sing feasting merrily
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath the autumn leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams become reality
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,At Habu Port The bold take to the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The retainers of Kozuki\NOdin Returned at long
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,last To battle they go\NA story of true loyalty
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So please allow me to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,tell this tale in modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our story begins on a dark,\Nstormy night not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One day before this year's fire festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, not far from\Nthe flower capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke and his friends\Nhead toward Tokage Port,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,hoping to catch Luffy before he sets sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you've changed your\Nmind about going to sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've already told Luffy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly want to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, it's\Nreassuring to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we last spoke, you told me that\Nyou had come to an important decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Odin started his journey\Nby traveling across Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even done that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So I decided to follow his path properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go out to see when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, but I can't believe Luffy\Ndiscussed his departure with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or more specifically, I can't believe\Nhe failed to discuss it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's leaving without saying\Ngoodbye to me and Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you here? Oh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm gonna be king\Nof the pirates someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the\Npirates someday! Ha! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be the Shogun of Wano someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll be like a worm beneath my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a worm, or an eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a monkey, you saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.78,0:05:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, these are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, a figurehead, huh, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gonna cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to vanquish Emmerichino!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a little crybaby\Nwith a dumb top knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, and you know it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find a way to survive, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang on, and we'll come rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kozuki Mowinosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall become the Shogun\Nof the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With your eyes open this time, I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to stop Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had our share of quarrels,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but does our adventure\Ntogether mean nothing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a limit to how much\Nboorishness I can tolerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're confusing personal\Nfreedom with disrespect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Tinemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't mind, I must ask,\Nwhy do you run when you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for my insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Sir Lucci must answer\Nfor disrespecting our Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cannot explain his vile actions\Nto us, we shall consider him an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is the way of Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that it is you who trampled\Non our friendship, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He humiliated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will strike him, then fight him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and then make him pain whatever\Nmanner I deem most suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're enemies\Nthe next time I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, you might end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you around, Jaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Move me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to send you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke! Chinaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, running\Noff without saying a word to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon and I have known you for longer\Nthan anyone else in Wano, you scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have deeply offended the both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You better have a good excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're seeing me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order from the Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can make it without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the reason I was able to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me the strength to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You all were the reason I\Nwas able to smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for avenging\Nmy father and mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I struggle to put this into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I fear what is to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not very Shogun-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go. Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We were waiting on the Sunny\Nso we could give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't Shogun's order\Nme, you got bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know you're still a kid You're also\Na dumb little scaredy-cat and a crybaby
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know you're like\Na little brother to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this your flag if things\Nget tough we've still got your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Back, fly that flag to send a\Nmessage. If bad guys see that, it'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,send a packet i promise you messing\Nwith our friend means messing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,with us and the Straw Hat pirates\Ndon't back down from a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend I'm one of you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoho! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinema Yamato Momo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys want to become pirates,\Nwe'll come and pick you up any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but not if you're just going to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Set and sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yama too! Stay tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it super proud! We shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me proud out there, Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck for my new stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go easy on the crying\Nand you'll do just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to have fun, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So take care until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will grow stronger each day\Ntill I surpass Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll make him proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Surpass me! Will you stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, to Hakumai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving. That's\Ntheir official port.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a lift there to\Nlower our ship to sea level
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not care for the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My bones were quaking\Njust thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats, why are\Nyou a trafalgar off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna use the\Nofficial port to leave water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good choice for you average\Npirates. Don't blame you one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys got to stay safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You amateurs should take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like that look\Non your face, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The official board is there for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an enabler, Bepo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Bane, let me take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Captain, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke's allies flew into\Nbattle like gods of vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tearing through lesser foes,\Nthey reached to the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,where they faced the\NDragon King Kaido himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A monstrous Oiran stood beside\Nhim, but even with her aid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the dragon could not\Nwithstand the winds of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,change that blew at the\Nbacks of our heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But nearby, despite being burned,\NOrochi had not met his end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Brimming with contempt, he targeted our\NPrincess Hiyori, Who stood her ground
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then whoosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Slash The vile serpent was\Nfelled in one cut But by who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Lord Odin's loyal retainer, Denjiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Odinji's final head was\Nset to blaze. The enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Kozuki clan Paid\Nfor his treachery At last
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder roared Kaido and Onigashima\Nitself were next to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For twenty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,dark clouds had covered the land of\NWano, blackening the entire realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, suddenly, the\Nclouds began to clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the flower capital,\Nthe festival carried on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Its lively music floated\Ninto the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But the snake lived, even\Nsevered from its neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The head of Oruji glared with spite,\Nand from its mouth, a warning came.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The grudge of the Kurozumi clan will curse
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Wano for generations to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your victory is but a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Hiyori stood firm,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,remembering the twenty years of\Nsuffering her people had endured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She returned the serpent's glare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori, stay away, cried Denjiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But she would not be deterred.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our brave princess didn't flinch\Nin the face of the serpent's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She delivered his obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.86,0:17:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The fan in her hand bore the Kozuki crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She bit her lip and\Ncounted up the serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sins, father, mother,\Nbrother, I deliver this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,verdict in the name of\Nall my people yeah the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,best part you know the\Nwords all together now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,black charcoal is called Kurozumi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,because it was born to burn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Twilight, songs ring out\Nin the city all night
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Crescent moon, in reverse\Nat the port of rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the tale is told,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,a victory for the brave and\Nbold Revenge is had at last
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for war and pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,has passed Our
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,country is free
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:19:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a story that will be\Npassed down for generations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,of those who returned and\Nwho returned peace to us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For today, that's all\Nthat has been written.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm certain that\Nthis tale will continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will be certain to tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where shall I fly this flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There is another one who cried again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, King, yaa,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,conna nunae, afulere deru,\Nkodoka da genšr, iqirena hai,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,maza na i Bekori nara,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ziyu na baqana eume.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ichinu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirai saiki o te Lost yuku,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zibun no zade Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sekaimo hate wa tomo ni muioo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get a flyer.
